least one stable identity and correct remap of all four.\n4. Cleanup evidence is exact per-board `get_setup_status`, `disconnect`, and post-disconnect status/refusal plus a final present-device snapshot.\n\nThis amendment supersedes the earlier mistaken manager approval note; S12 is not approved to execute until a targeted reviewer accepts this amendment.\n"}]}}
